  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "Following a moving point",
    "kn": "ಚಲಿಸುವ ಬಿಂದುವನ್ನು ಹಿಂಬಾಲಿಸಿ"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "A stone tied to a string moves so that x = cos t and y = sin t. We know x and y separately in terms of time. Can we still find the slope dy/dx of its path?",
    "kn": "ದಾರಕ್ಕೆ ಕಟ್ಟಿದ ಕಲ್ಲು x = cos t, y = sin t ಆಗುವಂತೆ ಚಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. x ಮತ್ತು y ಗಳು ಸಮಯದ ಮೂಲಕ ಬೇರೆ ಬೇರೆಯಾಗಿ ಗೊತ್ತು. ಅದರ ಪಥದ ಇಳಿಜಾರು dy/dx ಕಂಡುಹಿಡಿಯಬಹುದೇ?"
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Differentiate functions in parametric form"
    },
    {
     "en": "Find second-order derivatives"
    },
    {
     "en": "Verify differential relations"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "A stone tied to a string moves so that x = cos t and y = sin t. We know x and y separately in terms of time. Can we still find the slope dy/dx of its path?",
    "kn": "ದಾರಕ್ಕೆ ಕಟ್ಟಿದ ಕಲ್ಲು x = cos t, y = sin t ಆಗುವಂತೆ ಚಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. x ಮತ್ತು y ಗಳು ಸಮಯದ ಮೂಲಕ ಬೇರೆ ಬೇರೆಯಾಗಿ ಗೊತ್ತು. ಅದರ ಪಥದ ಇಳಿಜಾರು dy/dx ಕಂಡುಹಿಡಿಯಬಹುದೇ?"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Parametric differentiation"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "If $x = f(t)$ and $y = g(t)$, then $\\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}$, provided $\\frac{dx}{dt} \\ne 0$.",
    "kn": "x = f(t), y = g(t) ಆದರೆ dy/dx = (dy/dt) ÷ (dx/dt), dx/dt ≠ 0."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Differentiate x and y separately with respect to t"
    },
    {
     "en": "Divide dy/dt by dx/dt"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "When x and y are both given in terms of a parameter t, d y by d x is d y by d t divided by d x by d t.",
    "kn": "x = f(t), y = g(t) ಆದರೆ dy/dx = (dy/dt) ÷ (dx/dt), dx/dt ≠ 0."
   },
   "formula": "\\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}"
  },
  {
   "id": "wb1",
   "type": "whiteboard",
   "title": {
    "en": "Slopes through a parameter"
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "A point on the parabola x equals a t squared, y equals 2 a t moves with t. Divide the two rates."
     },
     "draw": [
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        4,
        4
       ],
       "tex": "x = at^2,\\ y = 2at",
       "size": 4,
       "color": "yellow"
      },
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        4,
        14
       ],
       "tex": "\\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt} = \\frac{2a}{2at} = \\frac{1}{t}",
       "size": 4,
       "color": "green"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "For the second derivative, differentiate 1 over t with respect to t, and divide again by d x by d t."
     },
     "draw": [
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        4,
        32
       ],
       "tex": "\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = \\frac{d}{dt}\\left(\\frac1t\\right)\\Big/\\frac{dx}{dt} = -\\frac{1}{2at^3}",
       "size": 4,
       "color": "orange"
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "at": [
        4,
        50
       ],
       "text": {
        "en": "Do not just divide second derivatives!"
       },
       "size": 3,
       "color": "red"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Second order without a parameter: if y equals A sin x plus B cos x, differentiating twice gives minus y."
     },
     "draw": [
      {
       "kind": "axes",
       "from": [
        4,
        6
       ],
       "to": [
        60,
        50
       ],
       "x": [
        -6.3,
        6.3
       ],
       "y": [
        -2.5,
        2.5
       ],
       "color": "white",
       "xLabel": "x",
       "yLabel": "y"
      },
      {
       "kind": "plot",
       "fn": "sin(x) + cos(x)",
       "color": "yellow"
      },
      {
       "kind": "plot",
       "fn": "-(sin(x) + cos(x))",
       "color": "green"
      },
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        64,
        8
       ],
       "tex": "y = A\\sin x + B\\cos x",
       "size": 3,
       "color": "yellow"
      },
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        64,
        18
       ],
       "tex": "y'' = -y",
       "size": 4,
       "color": "green"
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "at": [
        64,
        30
       ],
       "text": {
        "en": "Mirror in the x-axis"
       },
       "size": 3,
       "color": "white"
      }
     ],
     "clear": true
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "On the board: Slopes through a parameter."
